um is the daily complexion routine for founders and entrepreneurs.\",\n    \"isPartOf\": {\n      \"@id\": \"https://tavalabs.app/#website\"\n    },\n    \"publisher\": {\n      \"@id\": \"https://tavalabs.app/#organization\"\n    },\n    \"inLanguage\": \"en-US\"\n  }\n]\n"], "scripts": [{"src": "https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/webfont/1.6.26/webfont.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/about-9.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/about-10.js"}, {"src": "https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=6261782397372d8306f031ca"}, {"src": "/tava-webflow.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/about-11.js"}, {"src": "https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/smoothscroll/1.4.10/SmoothScroll.min.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/about-12.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/about-13.js"}, {"src": "/page-scripts/about-14.js"}], "bodyClass": "body", "htmlAttrs": {"data-wf-domain": "tavalabs.app", "data-wf-page": "6261782397372dac68f031c9", "data-wf-site": "6261782397372d8306f031ca"}, "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"section wf-section\"><div class=\"tava-page\">\n<style>\n.tava-page{max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 24px 24px;font-family:'Futura book font',sans-serif;color:#000000}\n.tava-page .tp-eyebrow{letter-spacing:.22em;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#B78B45;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 14px}\n.tava-page h1{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:42px;line-height:1.15;color:#000000;margin:0 0 18px}\n.tava-page h2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:26px;color:#000000;margin:38px 0 10px}\n.tava-page p,.tava-page li{font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#000000}\n.tava-page a{color:#B78B45}\n.tava-page .tp-lede{font-size:19px;line-height:1.6}\n.tava-page .tp-card{background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D8C19A;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px;margin:18px 0}\n.tava-page .tp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:16px;margin:22px 0}\n.tava-page .tp-badge{background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D8C19A;border-radius:16px;padding:18px;text-align:center}\n.tava-page .tp-badge img{width:72px;height:72px;object-fit:contain;margin:0 auto 10px;display:block}\n.tava-page .tp-badge .tp-badge-name{font-weight:700;color:#000000;margin-bottom:6px}\n.tava-page .tp-badge p{font-size:14px;margin:0}\n.tava-page .tp-cta{display:inline-block;background:#000000;color:#FFFFFF!important;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13.5px;text-decoration:none;margin:8px 10px 8px 0}\n.tava-page .tp-cta.alt{background:#000000;color:#FFFFFF!important}\n.tava-page ul{padding-left:20px}\n.tava-page .tp-fine{font-size:13.5px;color:#7A7261}\n</style>\n\n<p class=\"tp-eyebrow\">About Us</p>\n<h1>Skincare for the ambitious.</h1>\n<p class=\"tp-lede\">Build your business. Do not neglect yourself.</p>\n<p class=\"tp-lede\">Your appearance is part of your professional presence. Tava Labs is a personal maintenance brand for people building businesses. We make one product and we make it well. The PDRN Brightening Serum is a lightweight daily serum built for founders and entrepreneurs who pitch investors and sell on calls and record content and meet partners, and who understand that how they present themselves matters.</p>\n<p>Building a company asks everything of you, and the long days show on your face first. People read your energy and your composure before they finish hearing your idea. This serum is the daily preparation step that helps you look prepared and composed and polished, in the room and on camera. Looking ready is not vanity. It is part of presenting the business well.</p>\n<h2>The Serum</h2>\n<div class=\"tp-card\">\n<p><strong>PDRN Brightening Serum</strong> · 1 fl oz (30ml)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PDRN and acetyl hexapeptide-8 — for a more luminous, vibrant-looking complexion</li>\n<li>Sodium hyaluronate (hyaluronic acid), glycerin, and sodium PCA — deep hydration for plump, soft-looking skin</li>\n<li>Panthenol and propanediol — conditioning for a silky, comfortable feel</li>\n<li>Lightweight and fast-absorbing, with no greasy residue — made in the USA, for all skin types</li>\n<li>Use twice daily: 2 to 4 pumps on clean, dry skin, morning and night</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The daily complexion routine. One step in the morning and one step at night, made to fit a busy working day without a long grooming routine.</p>\n<p>$49 one-time, or $39/mo with Subscribe &amp; Save.</p>\n<a href=\"/glow-brightening-serum\" class=\"tp-cta\">Shop the Serum</a>\n<a href=\"/quiz\" class=\"tp-cta alt\">Take the Skin Quiz</a>\n</div>\n<h2>Our Philosophy</h2>\n<p>&ldquo;Healthy skin is the most attractive thing you can wear.&rdquo; That line sits under our primary belief. Invest in the person behind the company, because building a successful business should not mean neglecting yourself. PDRN Brightening Serum for founders remains our product line descriptor, and it supports the positioning rather than leading it.</p>\n<h2>Online Only</h2>\n<p>Tava Labs is an online-only business. We sell exclusively through tavalabs.app, and every order is shipped to the address you provide at checkout. Questions? Visit our <a href=\"/contact\">Contact Us</a> page or email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@tavalabs.app\">support@tavalabs.app</a>.</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "headerHtml": "<div class=\"header wf-section\"><div data-collapse=\"medium\" data-animation=\"default\" data-duration=\"0\" data-easing=\"ease\" data-easing2=\"ease\" role=\"banner\" class=\"navigation__wrapper w-nav\"><div data-w-id=\"046f07bb-b329-0abb-be87-d973823280a9\" style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\" class=\"nav__wrappper desktop\"><div class=\"nav__container\"><div class=\"nav__div__left\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"nav__logo__wrap w-nav-brand\"><img src=\"/assets/tava-logo.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"230\" style=\"filter:invert(0%)\" data-w-id=\"046f07bb-b329-0abb-be87-d973823280ad\" alt=\"Tava Labs\" class=\"nav__logo\"/></a></div><div class=\